WEBVTT

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:17.590
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:19.480
Yeah, I'm in here.

00:02:21.360 --> 00:02:23.030
I found you!

00:02:24.420 --> 00:02:25.110
What's up?

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:28.970
Look what I drew.

00:02:32.780 --> 00:02:33.650
So?

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:39.640
Is this me?

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:42.120
Is this for me?

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:42.920
Yep!

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:51.360
You are such a good girl!

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:54.980
Your drawings are much better than mine!

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:57.910
Really?

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:00.410
That makes me so happy!

00:03:05.380 --> 00:03:05.960
Oh yeah...

00:03:08.860 --> 00:03:10.220
Come here for a second.

00:03:17.150 --> 00:03:17.500
Look here.

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:29.500
Your mommy sent us these pictures a while ago.

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:33.920
Is that baby... me?

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:34.990
Yep!

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:37.920
I was tiny!

00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:41.390
Yeah. Well, you're still small.

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:57.350
Look how carefully she's holding you.
You must be incredibly important to her.

00:04:02.230 --> 00:04:04.510
I'm sure she misses you and will come back for you soon.

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:08.000
Do you think she will hold me like that again?

00:04:08.270 --> 00:04:08.710
Yeah.

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:19.630
Thank you for the drawing.

00:04:23.100 --> 00:04:24.030
How about we put this...

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:25.180
in the bathroom?

00:04:25.180 --> 00:04:26.140
No way!

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:30.200
But aren't I better looking than this?

00:04:46.710 --> 00:04:47.870
I'm going!

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:50.140
Goodbye!

00:04:50.590 --> 00:04:51.900
Relax and don't trip.

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:52.870
Okay.

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:55.850
Try to get along with everyone, alright?

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:56.630
Okay!

00:04:57.730 --> 00:04:58.500
Do you have your lunch?

00:04:59.490 --> 00:05:00.150
Yep.

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:01.680
Okay.

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:05.240
Good morning Yuzuyu-chan.

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:06.910
Good morning!

00:05:28.730 --> 00:05:31.400
Why do I have the feeling that I was being watched?

00:05:39.780 --> 00:05:41.280
Kippei-kun!

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:45.200
Mornin'!

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:47.190
Morning...

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:50.850
Hey, we should hang out together sometime.

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:52.010
Yeah, sometime...

00:05:55.070 --> 00:05:57.700
When is this "sometime"?

00:06:00.650 --> 00:06:02.110
I guess sometimes you just have to take a chance!

00:06:03.410 --> 00:06:03.980
Hey!

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:06.680
Look, this one's my favorite.

00:06:07.850 --> 00:06:08.950
Put those away!

00:06:09.060 --> 00:06:09.940
What?

00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:12.540
What's Kippei up to this time?

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:14.490
Kumi is so forward!

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:19.320
She may be, but that doesn't mean that Kippei has to drool over her.

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:21.290
It's fine, isn't it?

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:26.530
No one's thinking of having a serious relationship with Kippei anyway.

00:06:40.690 --> 00:06:41.820
What was that about?

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:44.720
If you bump into someone, then you should apologize!

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:48.240
That made me a bit angry, but I'm fine.

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:50.240
Good morning!

00:06:52.360 --> 00:06:53.430
What? Is something wrong?

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:56.840
There was a girl here a second ago who had your picture.

00:06:57.120 --> 00:06:58.200
It was very suspicious.

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:00.130
You're joking? What kind of girl?

00:07:00.590 --> 00:07:01.930
I'm not picky.

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:02.730
Huh?

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:05.330
Don't you have any standards?

00:07:06.710 --> 00:07:08.710
It wasn't a girl? Was it a guy?

00:07:09.810 --> 00:07:11.640
I don't know about guys...

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:16.810
That was a joke...

00:07:22.690 --> 00:07:23.330
Kokoro...

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:27.880
Isn't Tokunaga being a bit harsh towards me?

00:07:28.370 --> 00:07:30.890
She just dislikes you.

00:07:31.170 --> 00:07:32.290
No way...

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:34.020
Hey, wait up!

00:07:50.380 --> 00:07:52.210
Yuzuyu-chan!

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:55.560
Let's play together!

00:07:57.750 --> 00:07:58.420
Okay.

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:00.770
I'll make a river!

00:08:01.510 --> 00:08:03.000
I'll make a mountain!

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:05.700
Here you go.

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:18.070
Rice ball...

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:22.530
What's that?

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:24.080
It's shaped funny!

00:08:26.590 --> 00:08:29.140
Yuzuyu-chan, can you even eat that?

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:30.390
It looks gross.

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:33.470
What's wrong everyone?

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:35.350
Let's be quiet and eat.

00:08:49.860 --> 00:08:54.420
Ken-kun, I'm very sorry for hitting you the other day.

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:58.690
I'm a boy, so I'm fine now.

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:08.160
Yuzuyu-chan, you make a big mountain.

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:12.490
I'll make a deep river.

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:13.400
Okay!

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:16.710
Okay, there you go.

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:34.820
Oops... I dropped it.

00:09:41.940 --> 00:09:44.400
Marika-chan, do you want to play with us too?

00:09:45.030 --> 00:09:48.890
I don't want to play with Yuzuyu-chan.

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:54.410
Why?

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:56.910
Because...

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:02.830
you don't have a mama.

00:10:05.890 --> 00:10:10.970
My mama told me not to play with kids like you.

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:13.830
Marika-chan, what's wrong?

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:16.290
What did you just say about Yuzuyu-chan?

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:18.780
Hmm? Nothing really...

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:27.660
I'm sure she misses you and will come back for you soon.

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:35.920
I do have a mama!

00:10:36.800 --> 00:10:37.590
Then where is she?

00:10:41.190 --> 00:10:43.680
See? You don't have one...

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:46.460
What is it? Marika-chan, tell me...

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:48.640
I'll tell you later, okay?

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:52.470
Ken-kun, come on.

00:10:53.020 --> 00:10:55.330
But the mountain and the river...

00:10:55.860 --> 00:10:57.410
What are you talking about?

00:10:57.590 --> 00:10:59.350
Really, you're such a child.

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:10.600
Let's go.

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:11.200
Okay.

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:52.230
Alright!

00:11:59.300 --> 00:12:02.040
I'm going to get to the preschool on time today!

00:12:03.710 --> 00:12:04.600
Kippei.

00:12:05.340 --> 00:12:06.190
Eh, what?

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:08.550
What do you mean by that?

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:11.080
You left before we had a chance to finish things the other day...

00:12:13.490 --> 00:12:14.980
So, let's hang out today.

00:12:15.560 --> 00:12:18.170
I have plans today. Sorry.

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:19.190
I'll cry.

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:21.150
Hang out with someone else.

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:23.910
What is it with you? You always have other plans.

00:12:24.570 --> 00:12:26.140
Ah, I get it!

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:29.160
It's a girl.

00:12:31.030 --> 00:12:32.440
It's another girl!

00:12:33.380 --> 00:12:33.820
That's right.

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:34.800
Huh?

00:12:35.930 --> 00:12:36.490
A girl.

00:12:36.780 --> 00:12:38.350
What? Really?

00:12:39.140 --> 00:12:39.600
Really.

00:12:49.340 --> 00:12:50.330
What are you doing?

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:52.780
What's wrong?

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:56.410
Kippei, that good-for-nothing...

00:12:56.600 --> 00:12:57.520
Idiot!

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:01.030
Kippei's got... Kippei's got...

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:04.160
Kippei's got another girl! Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:07.840
Goodbye, Sensei!

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:14.830
Marika-chan.

00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:18.510
Mama! You're early today!

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:24.180
Mama has to speak with the principle, so you wait right here.

00:13:24.340 --> 00:13:25.460
Okay.

00:13:40.550 --> 00:13:41.550
Whoa, that was dangerous.

00:13:45.220 --> 00:13:45.940
Are you all right?

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:54.110
Be careful, okay?

00:14:02.050 --> 00:14:02.860
Yuzuyu!

00:14:08.010 --> 00:14:08.720
Hey...

00:14:12.090 --> 00:14:12.650
Yo!

00:14:17.730 --> 00:14:19.300
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:35.520
I want to hurry up and go home.

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:39.560
Ah, Katakura-san!

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:40.410
Oh, hello.

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:49.160
Goodbye, Yuzuyu-chan. See you tomorrow.

00:14:51.580 --> 00:14:52.660
Goodbye...

00:14:58.120 --> 00:14:59.180
I think I'm in love with Kippei.

00:15:00.070 --> 00:15:01.580
I wonder if he has a girlfriend.

00:15:01.820 --> 00:15:02.550
You...

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:10.460
Well, Marika, let's go home.

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:12.560
Mama!

00:15:12.840 --> 00:15:13.270
Yes?

00:15:14.650 --> 00:15:17.310
I want an older brother!

00:15:18.470 --> 00:15:19.990
W-What are you talking about?

00:15:20.150 --> 00:15:21.660
I said I want one too!

00:15:21.860 --> 00:15:23.550
I want one! I really want one!

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:24.450
Marika-chan?

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:25.980
I want a brother too!

00:15:26.210 --> 00:15:28.360
You are going to have an older brother for me!

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:30.410
Mother! Are you listening?!

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:39.340
I wonder if something happened again...

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:46.830
Okay. We're going to the convenience store.

00:15:47.020 --> 00:15:47.880
Convenience store?

00:15:48.560 --> 00:15:50.340
Yeah, I'm going to buy you some caramel.

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:51.610
Caramel?

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:53.210
Don't you know?

00:15:53.980 --> 00:15:56.520
When you eat caramel, it makes you happy.

00:16:02.300 --> 00:16:04.470
Excuse me, where is the caramel?

00:16:10.840 --> 00:16:13.760
Ah! My hat!

00:16:35.490 --> 00:16:36.230
That was dangerous.

00:16:39.610 --> 00:16:40.980
Here, be careful.

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:44.280
Thank you.

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:49.490
Are you Kippei's little sister?

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:53.410
You know Kippei-onii-chan?

00:16:56.860 --> 00:17:00.770
I'm not really Kippei-onii-chan's little sister.

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:06.600
My mama disappeared.

00:17:07.020 --> 00:17:10.530
So now Kippei-onii-chan is my mama.

00:17:20.800 --> 00:17:21.320
Is that so?

00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:25.350
You'll be just fine then.

00:17:28.010 --> 00:17:32.570
Yuzuyu!

00:17:34.420 --> 00:17:37.260
Yuzu, where did you go?

00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:42.230
Go on... the idiot is looking for you. You should hurry.

00:17:42.550 --> 00:17:43.030
Okay.

00:17:47.280 --> 00:17:49.280
Bye-bye, Onee-chan.

00:18:07.760 --> 00:18:09.730
Yuzu! Hey!

00:18:11.220 --> 00:18:12.690
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:14.090
You're here!

00:18:14.370 --> 00:18:15.690
I'm sorry!

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:19.850
Why did you run off like that?

00:18:20.690 --> 00:18:21.460
I'm sorry.

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:25.990
My hat flew away, and then Onee-chan...

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:27.860
Hmm? Onee-chan?

00:18:32.020 --> 00:18:33.040
There's no one there.

00:18:33.860 --> 00:18:35.040
She was just there.

00:18:38.950 --> 00:18:40.310
Yu-zu-yu.

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:45.350
Open your mouth and say "Ahh!"

00:18:48.580 --> 00:18:49.250
Does it taste good?

00:18:52.590 --> 00:18:53.990
I said, does it taste good?

00:18:58.510 --> 00:18:59.340
Why you...

00:19:02.590 --> 00:19:03.670
Okay, let's go home.

00:19:06.380 --> 00:19:06.790
Here.

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:25.540
Mama!

00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:29.300
I want to eat hamburgers tonight!

00:19:29.620 --> 00:19:32.600
But I already bought the ingredients to make curry.

00:19:32.950 --> 00:19:35.240
But I want hamburgers!

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:36.790
Don't be so selfish.

00:19:38.020 --> 00:19:39.620
Hamburgers!

00:19:44.040 --> 00:19:46.310
Yuzuyu-chan doesn't have a mama.

00:20:05.710 --> 00:20:06.350
What's up?

00:20:10.450 --> 00:20:15.150
Something made me feel really lonely today at preschool.

00:20:22.930 --> 00:20:27.300
I don't have a mama, but I have Kippei-onii-chan.

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:29.300
So I'm fine!

00:20:52.590 --> 00:20:53.930
Until your mama comes back...

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:56.160
I'll be right here for you.

00:21:04.900 --> 00:21:05.290
Okay.

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:07.900
Um...

00:21:09.820 --> 00:21:10.610
Forever?

00:21:10.970 --> 00:21:12.510
Yeah, forever.

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:15.760
Forever and ever?

00:21:16.800 --> 00:21:19.270
Yeah, forever and ever.

00:21:23.120 --> 00:21:23.890
Really?

00:21:24.460 --> 00:21:25.530
Yeah, really.

00:21:30.160 --> 00:21:32.170
Forever and ever, okay?

00:21:33.650 --> 00:21:35.660
Yep, forever and ever.

00:21:36.110 --> 00:21:36.520
Yep.

00:21:39.420 --> 00:21:41.290
The caramel was good.

00:21:41.980 --> 00:21:42.780
Would you like some more?

00:21:43.050 --> 00:21:43.610
Yep!

00:23:37.600 --> 00:23:39.640
Kippei-onii-chan, watch me!

00:23:46.980 --> 00:23:49.420
That's what I learned today.

00:23:53.200 --> 00:23:54.520
The teacher told me that I was doing it well.

00:23:54.850 --> 00:23:57.200
Who is that girl?

00:24:06.400 --> 00:24:09.590
Kippei, I thought you belonged to me.

00:24:19.390 --> 00:24:20.100
Ahh!

00:24:20.790 --> 00:24:22.040
You scared me!

00:24:23.060 --> 00:24:24.080
Did I really scare you?

00:24:24.420 --> 00:24:26.720
Kippei-onii-chan, you're so funny!

00:24:27.000 --> 00:24:27.980
Yeah, something is funny.

00:24:28.310 --> 00:24:32.570
I've felt a strange presence lately.

00:24:33.840 --> 00:24:35.150
It's bugging me.

00:24:35.260 --> 00:24:39.100
It would bug me too. What is the strange presence?

00:24:39.790 --> 00:24:41.370
Next time on Aishiteruze Baby:

00:24:41.790 --> 00:24:43.010
Yuzu's Crayons!

00:24:43.390 --> 00:24:44.340
Where did you get your crayons?

00:24:44.500 --> 00:24:46.840
Shh! Shh! I can't tell you!
